Function: vul_py_10_2
The function `_reverse_with_prefix` attempts to prevent the creation of scheme-relative URLs (which can lead to open redirects) by checking if a generated URL `url` starts with `//`. The sanitization logic `url = '/%%2F%s' % url[2:]` has two flaws:
